      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在云集了足以代表一个时代的名赛马娘\n与名门望族的聚会上，邀请你也就罢了，连\n我都受邀参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc85c786a3bcfb6b73047c7897f2cc68d9e14539709f8c435d704db9965f7a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
