    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67adbf4fd15584969cd539b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主带着略微出神的表情，缓缓吐出\n一口长气。……她果然，还是累了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1273b409f10b2d20bec7a149646780044ebc41977fc7c41400170e30da06844c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
