    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133484e1bec247ba54a6edb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――那么，我就先告辞了。\n今天真的非常感谢！\n失礼了。……回头见，救世主！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d8b8825811029ec27afb65399217aadc1bcfede3a0a2b389afef0c95a7cf7c",
