    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6707f2770e8919db3548148",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主的母亲乘出租车离去。\n聚会顺利结束，我们也像这样\n完成了送别――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e27e20fc0548de6c1e150befed78c0db1f126bb12b2d2719881a4346ed8f775",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
