      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……可从刚才起，\n空中救世主就显得有一点奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26a88c86f5e5c229b19f7a4039dad14a3d68e5d0aeff4ba89f20f87e3d93cdd1",
