    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a65e96cb20e21f42435c8f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我与仍显得有些奇怪的空中救世主，\n来到了装点着圣诞色彩的广场前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e29808743d72411b57e09ea5a2cdc9debc1c36257b4a747da8fd1e5400f7021",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
