      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实，我本打算在会场送给您的……\n可是该说是情况不合适，还是时机不对，\n……总之，我错过了机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1037d0e1a5e0040fd950da1376fe8650edb6fbba400126401c068fe524b2bed8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
