      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主送给我的……\n是一条触感舒适，款式简洁的围巾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c9149afa9ef51923b25c83837b85876b63fa537afcbdb512351734adef8b777",
