    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11af387d7a3eb8e6b4d6e637",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，是吗？\n虽然很荣幸……呵呵，可我好像要紧张起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb4165a4b7c4386cb2f02fe6435a259884f5a547d4da165b6e827ab9c482a252",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
