    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9151b6abb1ae2375540a2b15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我立刻，把围巾围到颈间\n空中救世主像是松了口气般露出了笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b679edf199fa5c7b4987bb4a0a9762168afb4b72c185ab116aca6184f88137a",
